[statement]
As `a-versioned-provided-name-is-not-followed-at-once`, with `b`
depending on the real `kw`: `kw` is installed before `v` is decided.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:a b

P:a
V:1
D:v

P:b
V:1
D:kw

P:kw
V:1
p:v w=1

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install kw 1
install a 1
install b 1
install app 1
